## 12. Key Phrases & Power Terms Cheat Sheet

| Term | One-Line Definition | Your Connection |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Lakehouse** | Data Lake + Warehouse ACID semantics | Databricks + Delta Lake |
| **Medallion Architecture** | Bronze / Silver / Gold data quality layers | `STG` → `PSG` → `BIW_DWH` |
| **Delta Lake** | Open-source ACID storage layer on object storage | Databricks Feature Store |
| **Time Travel** | Query historical data state by version or timestamp | Point-in-Time feature generation |
| **Unity Catalog** | Unified Databricks governance & lineage layer | Feature Store ACL management |
| **Delta Sharing** | Open protocol for cross-platform data sharing | Snowflake ↔ Databricks bridge |
| **Point-in-Time Join** | Feature lookup at historical timestamp — no leakage | PFS/PFUS ML training datasets |
| **Kimball Star Schema** | Fact + conformed dimension BI modeling standard | BIW_DWH core warehouse |
| **SCD Type 2** | History tracking via row versioning with close dates | `CDW_RECD_CURR_FLG` pattern |
| **Blue-Green Cutover** | Zero-downtime switch via view repointing | Oracle BIW → Snowflake migration |
| **Lambda Architecture** | Separate batch + speed layers (now avoided) | Replaced by unified Delta pipelines |
| **Kappa Architecture** | Single streaming pipeline for all data | What Delta Lake enables |
| **dbt Incremental** | Process only new/changed records via watermark | `CDW_PROCESS_KEY` merge pattern |
| **CDC (Change Data Capture)** | Track row-level changes from source systems | PSG layer ingestion strategy |

